{"duration": 34.95, "segs": [{"id": "hook", "start": 0.35, "end": 2.71, "text": "Avant, pour vendre, il te fallait une boutique."}, {"id": "auj", "start": 2.81, "end": 4.67, "text": "Aujourd'hui ? Un téléphone suffit."}, {"id": "versus", "start": 4.857, "end": 12.31, "text": "Avant, une pub télé coûtait une fortune. Aujourd'hui, une vidéo de trente secondes peut toucher des milliers de personnes, gratuitement."}, {"id": "trois", "start": 12.382, "end": 20.11, "text": "Mais attention, ça marche seulement avec trois choses : une niche précise, de la valeur dans chaque vidéo, et de la régularité."}, {"id": "erreur", "start": 20.323, "end": 24.51, "text": "La plupart abandonnent après dix vidéos. Ceux qui gagnent, ils continuent."}, {"id": "fin", "start": 24.79, "end": 32.35, "text": "J'explique tout, étape par étape, dans ma formation de marketing digital. Écris VIP en commentaire, et je t'envoie tout."}], "words": [{"w": "Avant,", "a": 0.35, "b": 0.83, "seg": "hook"}, {"w": "pour", "a": 0.862, "b": 0.99, "seg": "hook"}, {"w": "vendre,", "a": 1.038, "b": 1.47, "seg": "hook"}, {"w": "il", "a": 1.497, "b": 1.55, "seg": "hook"}, {"w": "te", "a": 1.603, "b": 1.71, "seg": "hook"}, {"w": "fallait", "a": 1.726, "b": 1.87, "seg": "hook"}, {"w": "une", "a": 1.91, "b": 2.03, "seg": "hook"}, {"w": "boutique.", "a": 2.083, "b": 2.71, "seg": "hook"}, {"w": "Aujourd'hui", "a": 2.81, "b": 3.23, "seg": "auj"}, {"w": "?", "a": 3.39, "b": 3.55, "seg": "auj"}, {"w": "Un", "a": 3.577, "b": 3.63, "seg": "auj"}, {"w": "téléphone", "a": 3.686, "b": 4.19, "seg": "auj"}, {"w": "suffit.", "a": 4.238, "b": 4.67, "seg": "auj"}, {"w": "Avant,", "a": 4.857, "b": 5.39, "seg": "versus"}, {"w": "une", "a": 5.43, "b": 5.55, "seg": "versus"}, {"w": "pub", "a": 5.61, "b": 5.79, "seg": "versus"}, {"w": "télé", "a": 5.838, "b": 6.03, "seg": "versus"}, {"w": "coûtait", "a": 6.057, "b": 6.27, "seg": "versus"}, {"w": "une", "a": 6.31, "b": 6.43, "seg": "versus"}, {"w": "fortune.", "a": 6.51, "b": 7.39, "seg":